; Width, colour, and points are all set from the script every frame — colour because it
; carries the amber-then-red warning, points because the other end of this line is a moving
; player. Authored here only so there is exactly one of them and nothing has to build it.
;
; Behind the sprite, like Firewall Node's beams, so the body stays readable as the thing to
; shoot rather than being crossed out by its own attack.
